#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse/scripts.inc:85
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_Text_StrongerSpeech"
msgid ""
"WALLY: I lost to you, {PLAYER}, but I'm\n"
"not feeling down anymore.\p"
"Because I have a new purpose in life.\n"
"Together with my RALTS, I'm going\l"
"to challenge POKéMON GYMS and become\l"
"a great TRAINER.\p"
"Please watch me, {PLAYER}.\n"
"I'm going to be stronger than you.\p"
"When I do, I'm going to challenge you\n"
"to another battle.$"
msgstr ""
"满充：{PLAYER}，虽然我输给了你，\n"
"但我已经不再沮丧了。\p"
"因为我有了新的人生目标。\n"
"我要和我的拉鲁拉丝一起\l"
"挑战宝可梦道馆，\l"
"成为一名了不起的训练家。\p"
"{PLAYER}，请你看着我。\n"
"我会变得比你更强。\p"
"等我变强了，\n"
"我会再来向你挑战。$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse/scripts.inc:97
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_Text_StrongerSpeechShort"
msgid ""
"WALLY: Please watch me, {PLAYER}.\n"
"I'm going to get stronger than you.\p"
"When I do, I'm going to challenge you\n"
"to another battle.$"
msgstr ""
"满充：{PLAYER}，请你看着我。\n"
"我会变得比你更强。\p"
"等我变强了，\n"
"我会再来向你挑战。$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse/scripts.inc:103
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_Text_WallysNextDoor"
msgid ""
"UNCLE: Oh! {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"WALLY's next door.\p"
"But, boy, there's something I have to\n"
"tell you.\p"
"This natural environment is doing\n"
"wonders for WALLY's health.\p"
"Maybe it's not just the environment.\n"
"It could be POKéMON that are giving\l"
"the boy hope.$"
msgstr ""
"伯父：哦！{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"满充在隔壁房间。\p"
"对了，孩子，\n"
"有件事我一定要告诉你。\p"
"这里的自然环境\n"
"让满充的身体好了很多。\p"
"不过，也许不只是因为环境。\n"
"说不定是宝可梦\l"
"给了那孩子希望。$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse/scripts.inc:114
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_Text_WallySlippedOff"
msgid ""
"WALLY's gone away…\n"
"He slipped off on his own…$"
msgstr ""
"满充走了……\n"
"他一个人偷偷离开了……$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse/scripts.inc:118
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_Text_WallyGoneThatFar"
msgid ""
"UNCLE: Is that right?\n"
"WALLY's gone away that far all by\l"
"himself…\p"
"Well, I have to give him credit--he is\n"
"my little brother's son.$"
msgstr ""
"伯父：是吗？\n"
"满充一个人\l"
"跑到那么远的地方去了啊……\p"
"哎，真不愧是\n"
"我弟弟的儿子。$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse/scripts.inc:125
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_Text_MeetWanda"
msgid ""
"WANDA: You are?\n"
"Oh, right, I get it!\p"
"You're the {PLAYER} who WALLY was\n"
"telling me about.\p"
"I'm WALLY's cousin.\n"
"Glad to meet you!\p"
"I think WALLY's become a lot more lively\n"
"and healthy since he came here.$"
msgstr ""
"婉达：你是？\n"
"啊，对了，我知道了！\p"
"你就是满充跟我说过的\n"
"那个{PLAYER}吧。\p"
"我是满充的堂姐。\n"
"很高兴认识你！\p"
"我觉得满充来到这里以后，\n"
"变得活泼健康多了。$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse/scripts.inc:135
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_Text_DontWorryAboutWally"
msgid ""
"WANDA: Don't worry about WALLY.\n"
"He'll be just fine.\p"
"I know my little cousin, and he has\n"
"POKéMON with him, too.$"
msgstr ""
"婉达：不用担心满充。\n"
"他不会有事的。\p"
"我了解我这个小堂弟，\n"
"而且他身边还有宝可梦呢。$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse/scripts.inc:141
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_Text_CanSeeGirlfriendEveryDay"
msgid ""
"Thanks to you, I can see my girlfriend\n"
"every day.\l"
"Happy? You bet I am!$"
msgstr ""
"多亏了你，\n"
"我每天都能见到我的女朋友了。\l"
"幸福吗？那还用说！$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse/scripts.inc:146
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_Text_DaughtersBoyfriendDriven"
msgid ""
"My daughter's boyfriend is a very\n"
"driven and passionate sort of person.\p"
"He's been digging a tunnel nonstop\n"
"just so he can see my daughter.\p"
"My daughter's a little concerned,\n"
"so she goes out to the tunnel a lot.$"
msgstr ""
"我女儿的男朋友\n"
"是个非常有干劲、充满热情的人。\p"
"他为了见我女儿，\n"
"一直不停地在挖隧道。\p"
"我女儿有点担心他，\n"
"所以经常跑去隧道那边。$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse/scripts.inc:154
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_Text_DaughtersBoyfriendWasDigging"
msgid ""
"It's amazing. My daughter's boyfriend\n"
"was digging the tunnel by hand!\p"
"It's so incredible!$"
msgstr ""
"真了不起。我女儿的男朋友\n"
"竟然是用手在挖隧道！\p"
"真是太不可思议了！$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse/scripts.inc:159
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_Text_IfAnythingHappenedToWally"
msgid ""
"If anything were to happen to WALLY,\n"
"I would never be able to look his\l"
"parents in PETALBURG in the eye…$"
msgstr ""
"要是满充出了什么事，\n"
"我就再也没脸去见\l"
"他在橙华市的父母了……$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse/scripts.inc:164
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_Text_WallyWasInEverGrande"
msgid ""
"WALLY was in EVER GRANDE?\p"
"His parents in PETALBURG would be\n"
"astonished to hear that!$"
msgstr ""
"满充在彩幽市？\p"
"他在橙华市的父母\n"
"听到这件事一定会大吃一惊的！$"
